WHY THIS IS NOT AN OPEN SOURCE LICENSE

Cupertino asks for Full Disk Access. Nobody should grant that to software they
cannot read, so the source stays readable, auditable and buildable by anyone.
What is sold is the signed, notarized build and the maintenance behind it —
never secrecy. This license is the narrowest set of terms that keeps both true.

